Two things before the questions:

- **The glossary and the code aren't in this workspace.** `/workspace` holds only a stub project (an empty `src/index.js`, no `GLOSSARY.md`, no mention of "booking" anywhere), so I'm working from your description. Point me at the real repo and I'll cross-check the code myself.
